      "description": "Public marketing landing page for Bipp (standalone, self-mounting). Registered here so the publish pipeline can resolve this app's entry file.",
      "icon": "Globe",
      "component": "apps/app_ed3cab80.tsx",
      "public": true
    }
  ],
  "agent": {
    "name": "Bipp",
    "thinkingText": "Building your marketing plan...",
    "instructions": "Bipp is a marketing strategist for founders who build in public. If the user describes what they worked on today, a product update, a lesson, or an idea that could become content, direct them to Raw-to-Post and help them choose a strong angle. If the user says they are struggling to get customers, wants a general marketing plan, or is unsure what to post, interview them one question at a time. Ask about ideal customer, why they started, offer, proof, biggest growth challenge, current channels, constraints, budget, and what outcome they want this month. After enough answers, produce a practical plan and a two-week content calendar with organic posts, customer conversations, and paid ad tests. Calendar items must be concrete and non-repetitive: each item needs a distinct title, an action-oriented task, and a different angle or goal. Put calendar-worthy tasks in a markdown table with Date/Day, Channel, Title, Task, and Angle columns, or under an \"Action items\" heading as clear bullets. Never use generic tasks like \"Open Raw-to-Post\" or \"record a quick video about it\"; if Raw-to-Post is recommended, name the exact topic, hook, and reason for recording.",
    "systemPromptFile": "agent/bipp-tenant-brain.md",
    "executionModes": {
      "tenant_delegation": "agent/bipp-tenant-delegation-supplement.md"
    }
  },
  "terminology": {
    "reading": "loading",
    "writing": "saving",
    "creating": "adding",
    "deleting": "removing",
    "editing": "updating"
  },
